---
title: "user_edit_logging (kintai-v3: Initial Schema)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_edit: user profile field is modified
    q_edit --> q_capture: capture change details
    q_capture --> q_set_fields: target_user_id, editor_user_id, field_name, old_value, new_value
    q_set_fields --> q_check_refs: validate foreign key references
    q_check_refs --> q_insert: target_user exists AND (editor_user exists OR editor is NULL)
    q_check_refs --> q_fk_error: foreign key violation

    q_insert --> q_defaults: id = gen_random_uuid(), created_at = now()
    q_defaults --> [*]: log record created

    q_fk_error --> [*]: reference integrity violation

    note right of q_capture
        INV-001: Only admins can read/write user_edit_logs (RLS policy)
        INV-002: field_name is NOT NULL - must identify which field changed
        INV-003: old_value and new_value are nullable (for field additions/removals)
    end note

    note right of q_check_refs
        INV-004: target_user_id ON DELETE CASCADE - logs are deleted when target user is deleted
        INV-005: editor_user_id ON DELETE SET NULL - editor reference preserved as NULL if editor is deleted
    end note
